menu "XPRS over Reticulum"

config XPRS_BEARER_RNS
    bool "Reticulum bearer for the XPRS archiver"
    default n
    help
        Puts this station's archiver on Reticulum: a TCP uplink to a hub or
        to a nearby Aurora node, XPRS wires carried as signed wapp-datagram
        announces (tag "xprs"), and inbound ones fed to the same funnel every
        radio feeds. Costs roughly one task stack, one TCP connection's
        windows and the Ed25519 arithmetic -- leave it off on boards without
        the memory; everything compiles to no-ops when disabled.

endmenu
